  "result": "Quiz 0002 is ready. It has six items on O4 (workflows versus agents, and when a fixed workflow is the better choice). The quiz is in `quizzes/0002.json` and the key is in `keys/0002.json`.\n\n- **q1–q3 (multiple choice):** who owns the control flow, classifying a routing design, and choosing a design for the booking step.\n- **q4 (short):** why a fixed workflow suits your budget.\n- **q5 (numeric):** a cost comparison using your $30 budget.\n- **q6 (short):** when an open-ended request calls for an agent.\n\nThe quiz is ahead of the lessons, because there is no O4 lesson yet. I wrote it from the common definitions: a workflow follows code-defined paths, and an agent has the model direct its own steps. I didn't search for a source this session, so I didn't add one to `RESOURCES.md`.\n\nI didn't use misconception ids in the key. The existing ones don't cover these ideas, and I didn't want to invent new ids.\n\nWant me to write a lesson on O4 before you take the quiz?",
